  <Entries>k__BackingField:
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Powering down...
    <Portrait>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 47b819f40cdbe364da6981351650c680, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Slowly, the shaking subsides. After checking that the
